   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: round 1 addressed in bad8b0dd (author w1155, Sonnet 5.5).\n\n1. Frame and contentShape now sit after the glass (`PagerPillLabel` hugs its text, tested). But on the tab-root strip the strip's `.glass` style wraps the frame, so the visible capsule is still 44 pt (was ~34): rendered, described under \"What visibly changes\". Needs an operator call.\n2. Rendered iPad bottom bar and strip, light and dark: one capsule on the bar, no nesting, nothing missing. Reduce Transparency could not be enabled in the simulator (no capture). Accessibility Inspector audit listed under \"Not covered\".\n3. `PagerToolbar.bottomBarPillDrawsGlass` + a test on it.\n4. `.rect` content shape.\n5. accessibility3 case relabelled as a guard.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
