   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: round 2 addressed in 7d5410e3 (+ 9be46f08, a line wrap only, not rebuilt).\n\n1. Cause probed: `glassEffect` on a Menu label fills the Menu bounds (the 44 pt frame); the strip `.glass` style is not involved (Menu `.plain` overrides it). PR body corrected.\n2. `PagerToolbar.pillDrawsGlass(in:)` is read by both placements; tested per placement.\n3. Accessibility Inspector audit and Reduce Transparency are listed under \"Not covered\"; the coordinator posts them on #893.\n4. Test comment reworded.\n5. Operator decision: strip arrows now 44 pt capsules (test red 35x29 / 37x31, then green), pill and arrows uniform. fix2 renders checked, light and dark.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
